            %p If we now suppose that one zigzag identity holds:
            %div
              %svg{:height => "200", "se:nonce" => "42715", :width => "300", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", "xmlns:se" => "http://svg-edit.googlecode.com"}
